    "make_it":  [
                    "Add the chicken breast, chopped onion, minced garlic, and grated ginger to the crock.",
                    "Pour in both cans of tomato sauce, drop in the butter with a drizzle of olive oil and the lemon juice, then stir in the garam masala, chili powder, ground cumin, cayenne, and the bay leaves.",
                    "Cover and cook on low for 6 to 8 hours until the chicken is tender.",
                    "Shred the chicken, fish out the bay leaves, then stir in the milk, Greek yogurt, and half and half for that creamy finish, and season with salt and pepper.",
